# Root-context builds are default-deny so ignored local credentials, editor
# state, worktrees, and unrelated products are never sent to a builder.
**
!.dockerignore
!libs/
!libs/stacks/
!libs/stacks/**
!apis/
!apis/network/
!apis/network/**
!operators/
!operators/network/
!operators/network/**
!operators/action/
!operators/action/**
!operators/observability/
!operators/observability/**

# The selected module trees still exclude development-only content.
**/.cache
**/.claude
**/.docs
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.git
**/.idea
**/.vscode
**/coverage
**/testdata
**/tools
**/node_modules
**/*_test.go
**/*.md
**/Makefile
